				<div class="citation-wrapper"><h5>Suggested Citation</h5> <p>Hammack, Beth M.
		
			
			
			
			
			
			
				
					
					
					
					
					
					&ldquo;Balancing Act: The Dual Mandate on an Economic Tightrope.&rdquo;
				Speech,
			The Economic Club of New York, New York, New York,
			November
06,
2025.
			
							
			
				
			

